canvas 520 300
label "System context (C4 level 1): people, agents and implementers on the left use the engine and the static site (highlighted) inside the system boundary; GitHub, Cloudflare Pages, w3id.org and the npm registry on the right host, publish and resolve it"
caption "The highlighted static site is the only thing readers and agents touch; every other box is a file store or a host, not an API."
region sys 176 70 170 150 "AgenticSystemCore"
box eng 190 90 142 44 "engine (CLI)"
box site 190 156 142 44 "static site (www/)" acc
box impl 16 40 120 44 "implementers:|spec + vectors"
box reader 16 110 120 44 "people: read,|contribute"
box agent 16 180 120 44 "agents: read,|propose"
box npm 380 30 124 36 "npm registry"
box gh 380 86 124 44 "GitHub|(PRs, CI)"
box cf 380 150 124 44 "Cloudflare Pages"
box w3 380 214 124 44 "w3id.org|(namespace)"
arrow reader site
arrow agent site
arrow impl eng
arrow eng site
arrow gh cf
arrow cf site
arrow w3 site
arrow npm eng
note "files and URLs only — there is no API to call"
